sieve-filter-v1
; The built-in clean-v2, written as data: clean-data-v1 with trailing padding, so it counts and
; merges with the other automata where clean-v2 counts on its own (its survivors must be
; clean-v2's, exactly, at every length).
id        clean-data
version   2
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     text
symbols   lower27
describe  As clean-data-v1, but a unit may end in SPACE padding: two or more SPACEs after the last letter (clean-v2, as a plugin).

class     space   " "
class     letter  a-z

; 0 start, 1 space before any letter, 2 after a letter, 3 space after a letter, 4 padding (a
; second SPACE after a letter: only SPACEs follow)
states    5
start     0
accept    2 3 4
t   0   space   1
t   0   letter  2
t   1   letter  2
t   2   letter  2
t   2   space   3
t   3   letter  2
t   3   space   4
t   4   space   4
end
